# Deploy (GitHub Pages)

Pages repo: `/home/name/Desktop/web/namenameemail.github.io/`  
Source stays in `rasterscape`. Pages gets **built files only**.

| Build | URL | Folder |
|-------|-----|--------|
| Current (`gpu-pipeline` / main line) | https://namenameemail.github.io/rasterscape/ | `…/rasterscape/` |
| Early (`deploy/early`, commit `779f095`) | https://namenameemail.github.io/rasterscape-early/ | `…/rasterscape-early/` |
| +1 month (`deploy/1m`, commit `202ccbb`) | https://namenameemail.github.io/rasterscape-1m/ | `…/rasterscape-1m/` |
| +2 months (`deploy/2m`, commit `821d72d`) | https://namenameemail.github.io/rasterscape-2m/ | `…/rasterscape-2m/` |
| +6 months (`deploy/6m`, commit `56faa74`) | https://namenameemail.github.io/rasterscape-6m/ | `…/rasterscape-6m/` |
