## Current

```sh
npm run deploy
```

[`scripts/deploy.sh`](scripts/deploy.sh): `vite build` (`base: './'`) → replace `rasterscape/` → commit + push pages. Override: `PAGES_DIR=…`.

Skip `tsc` on purpose (`npm run build` often fails on type debt). Do not set `base` back to `/`.

## Early (`deploy/early`)

First real app commit (after empty CRA): `779f095` *canvas & selection*. Branch only adds `"homepage": "/rasterscape-early"`.

Worktree (if present): `/home/name/Desktop/web/rasterscape-early-src`.

```sh
# Node 12 required (node-sass 4 / CRA 3)
. "$HOME/.nvm/nvm.sh" && nvm use 12
cd /home/name/Desktop/web/rasterscape-early-src   # or checkout deploy/early
unset CI   # CI=true turns eslint warnings into build errors
npm ci && npm run build
rm -rf ../namenameemail.github.io/rasterscape-early
cp -a build/. ../namenameemail.github.io/rasterscape-early/
# then commit + push namenameemail.github.io
```

Do not overwrite `rasterscape/` with the early build.

